# iOS Home Bouncy — an iOS home grid whose icons replay an "app open" bounce
# (withSequence of springs on a module-level makeMutable progress) on tap; a long
# press opens a blurred modal "spring customizer" with Opening/Closing tabs
# (Keyframe enter/exit) and Mass/Damping/Stiffness sliders writing the configs;
# pulling the modal down dismisses it (and replays the bounce past 120pt).
# What this test covers: replaying the bounce, re-tapping mid-sequence; long
# press -> modal; Opening sliders driven to the extremes (mass 100, damping 1,
# stiffness 500) and the bounce played with that config; Closing tab sliders
# to damping 200 / stiffness 1 and played again; switching tabs back and
# forth quickly (keyframes interrupted); a short pull that snaps back and a
# long pull that dismisses; finally every slider dragged back near its default
# (the configs are module-level and survive closing the demo).
# Slider thumbs are dragged by position (rows y 269/375/479, track x 61-317);
# restore drags add ~15pt for the pan activation slop.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/ios-home-bouncy"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 3000
press 201 450
wait 600
press 201 450
wait 3500
# Customizer: Opening extremes.
longpress 201 450 800
wait "text" "Stiffness" 4000
wait 800
gesture pan 112 269 260 0 700
wait 300
gesture pan 162 375 -150 0 700
wait 300
gesture pan 153 479 230 0 700
wait 500
wait "text" "100.0" 2000
wait "text" "500.0" 2000
# Short pull: snaps back.
gesture pan 201 600 0 50 500
wait 900
# Tabs back and forth quickly.
press "label=\"Closing\""
wait 150
press "label=\"Opening\""
wait 150
press "label=\"Closing\""
wait 900
# Closing extremes.
gesture pan 83 375 290 0 700
wait 300
gesture pan 112 479 -100 0 700
wait 500
wait "text" "200.0" 2000
# Long pull: replays the bounce and dismisses.
gesture pan 201 600 0 200 500
wait 1500
press 201 450
wait 6000
press 201 450
wait 300
press 201 450
wait 6000
# Restore everything near the defaults.
longpress 201 450 800
wait "text" "Stiffness" 4000
wait 800
gesture pan 317 269 -220 0 900
wait 300
gesture pan 61 375 113 0 900
wait 300
gesture pan 317 479 -180 0 900
wait 300
press "label=\"Closing\""
wait 900
gesture pan 317 375 -249 0 900
wait 300
gesture pan 61 479 63 0 900
wait 300
press "label=\"Opening\""
wait 900
gesture pan 201 600 0 200 500
wait 1500
press 201 450
wait 3500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
